     "n": "audio/e5e72db3b9560276.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "Hello! My name is Tom. I am twelve years old.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0103": {
   "audio": {
    "af_heart": {
     "n": "audio/0cfd9754253cc389.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "I have a brother and two sisters.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0104": {
   "audio": {
    "bf_emma": {
     "n": "audio/00e1b390bd81370f.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "The book is on the table.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0105": {
   "audio": {
    "af_bella": {
     "n": "audio/47f7ba68461d5932.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "I get up at seven o'clock.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0106": {
   "audio": {
    "bf_emma": {
     "n": "audio/a5446b4a9af8e469.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "Go straight on and turn left at the bank. The bus stop is right there.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0107": {
   "audio": {
    "am_michael": {
     "n": "audio/475e55f59a7e84c0.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "The train to London leaves at half past nine from platform four.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0108": {
   "audio": {
    "af_heart": {
     "n": "audio/8dda358bf5886bc6.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "I can't come to the party tonight because I have to study for a test.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0109": {
   "audio": {
    "af_bella": {
     "n": "audio/c44fd4e36057adeb.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "Could I have a cheese sandwich and an orange juice, please?",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0110": {
   "audio": {
    "am_michael": {
     "n": "audio/0c4d050f09ffa50e.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "I was going to walk to school, but it started raining, so my dad gave me a lift.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0111": {
   "audio": {
    "bf_emma": {
     "n": "audio/e3e938790daa3f1a.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "If I'd known the shop was closed on Sundays, I wouldn't have come all the way here.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0112": {
   "audio": {
    "af_heart": {
     "n": "audio/b49854cea7e6e774.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "She said she'd rather stay in and watch a film than go out tonight.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0113": {
   "audio": {
    "af_bella": {
     "n": "audio/2e3446d344ccc5df.mp3"
    }
   },
   "en": "I've been learning to play the guitar for about two years, but I still can't read music.",
   "lesson": "0001",
   "srs": false
  },
  "a0201": {
   "audio": {
    "am_michael": {
     "n": "audio/8105baba11552fa4.mp3"
    }
   },
